PURPOSE
===============================================================================

Game Day Tools is the primary operational reference page for Cypress AYSO
Region 154 referees preparing for and completing match assignments.

The page is designed to:

- Explain how MatchTrak will be used once Fall schedules are published.
- Prevent volunteers from using an old competition or schedule link.
- Help referees determine whether an assignment is appropriate.
- Explain pregame preparation and field arrival.
- Explain the referee crew’s basic game-day responsibilities.
- Describe the Region 154 volunteer-referee and NOCRA operating model.
- Route users to current seasonal referee-credit information.
- Explain game-card and reporting responsibilities without publishing an
  unapproved field-specific collection procedure.
- Explain safety, incident escalation and referee-protection expectations.
- Connect users to all other redesigned referee pages.
- Provide local and cross-page navigation without JavaScript.

