        <!-- ================================================================
             FAQ
             ================================================================ -->

        <section class="r154-gameday-section">

            <div class="r154-gameday-section-heading">

                <span class="r154-gameday-eyebrow">
                    Common Game-Day Questions
                </span>

                <h2 class="r154-gameday-section-title">
                    Game Day Tools FAQ
                </h2>

            </div>


            <div class="r154-gameday-faq-grid">

                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        When will Fall MatchTrak schedules be available?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        They will be added after the Fall competitions are
                        finalized. Game Day Tools will contain the approved
                        links.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        May I use last season’s MatchTrak link?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        No. Old competitions may contain outdated teams,
                        divisions, fields and assignment records.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        How early should I arrive?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Arrive early enough to check in, inspect the field,
                        meet the crew and conduct the required pregame duties.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        May a new referee accept any open assignment?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Select an assignment appropriate for your certification,
                        experience and available mentoring.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        Does NOCRA replace volunteer referees?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        No. Region 154 continues to rely on certified AYSO
                        volunteers for Assistant Referee and eligible Center
                        Referee assignments.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        How does my team receive referee credit?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Follow the current MatchTrak reservation, team-
                        identification and field check-in process shown for the
                        season.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        Where do I submit the completed game card?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Follow the instructions for the field and competition.
                        Ask the Field Marshal or Center Referee when uncertain.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        What events require a referee report?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Misconduct, serious injuries, match termination and
                        other significant incidents may require formal
                        reporting.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        What should I do when the referee crew is incomplete?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Notify the Center Referee, Field Marshal or Region
                        referee representative before changing assignments or
                        match procedures.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        What should a youth referee do when confronted?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Do not argue. Move toward the referee crew or another
                        trusted adult and request immediate assistance.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        Where can I review the division rules?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Use Rules &amp; Learning for current Laws, Region
                        guidance and Build-Out Line resources.
                    </p>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-gameday-faq-card">

                    <h3>
                        Who should I contact about an assignment problem?
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Email the Regional Referee Administrator with the match,
                        date, field, referee role and a description of the
                        problem.
                    </p>

                </article>

            </div>


